        ["The theme's"] = "主題顏色",
        ["The theme's, or by direction: green when you are heading the right way, yellow when the target is to the side, red when it is behind you."] = "主題顏色，或依方向：方向正確時為綠色，目標在側面時為黃色，在身後時為紅色。",
        ["The walking path planned by the guide, around cliffs and water: a green mark on the compass shows the way to go, orange when you stray from it. Automatic: except when Shortest Path Forever guides you."] = "指南規劃的步行路線，繞開懸崖和水域：指南針上的綠色標記顯示該走的方向，偏離時變為橘色。自動：Shortest Path Forever 為你導航時除外。",
        ["The window with the current step and the next ones."] = "顯示目前及後續步驟的視窗。",
