        ["Those the guide still takes: not those it abandons, marks done or leaves behind, nor escorts shared by the group. You can still take them by hand."] = "僅限指南仍會接取的任務：不包括它放棄的、標記為完成或已跳過的任務，也不包括隊伍共享的護送任務。你仍可手動接取。",
        ["Trainers, talents, flights and loot"] = "訓練師、天賦、飛行與拾取",
