        ["Water to keep"] = "保留水的數量",
        ["When a dungeon of the guide comes near, in the chat: the quests to have in your log going in (taken already, to pick up on the way, or starting inside) and its level. /fg lfg writes the group message, sent with Enter."] = "指南中的地城接近時，在聊天中顯示：進入時任務日誌中應有的任務（已接、途中要接或在裡面開始的）及其等級。/fg lfg 會寫好組隊訊息，按 Enter 送出。",
        ["When the flight map opens (Shift to choose yourself)."] = "開啟飛行地圖時（按住 Shift 自行選擇）。",
