        ["Window size"] = "視窗大小",
        ["With ElvUI, EllesmereUI or SpartanUI: their style instead of Factoruide's. Applied after /reload."] = "使用 ElvUI、EllesmereUI 或 SpartanUI 時：用它們的風格代替 Factoruide 的風格。/reload 後生效。",
        ["World map and group"] = "世界地圖與隊伍",
        ["Your XP ahead of or behind the guide by more than the chosen gap (mobs killed on the way, deaths, a dungeon), or far from the step for a while: a bar on the guide offers to re-plan from here (/fg replan at any time)."] = "經驗領先或落後於指南超過所選差距（路上擊殺的怪物、死亡、副本），或長時間遠離目前步驟時：指南上的橫欄會提議從這裡重新規劃（隨時可用 /fg replan）。",
